    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this physics-based building puzzle platformer, <i>you</i> place the platforms and must then reach the top of your own creations. Help Bob through 42 meticulously crafted levels in his career from apprentice to architect by building the tallest structures imaginable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trust me, I'm an engineer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/5fcb143446fd5b05459b3c7c6162672d.poster.avif?t=1755506693\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/5fcb143446fd5b05459b3c7c6162672d.webm?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/5fcb143446fd5b05459b3c7c6162672d.mp4?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engineering degree or not, with your help Bob can prevail!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/0458f07ab480e59b284dc59535c2de1c.poster.avif?t=1755506693\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/0458f07ab480e59b284dc59535c2de1c.webm?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/0458f07ab480e59b284dc59535c2de1c.mp4?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, you're faced with new challenges and can only use a finite number of objects. Place, rotate and stack the objects to make them fit where you want and ultimately create a climbable structure that takes you to the top. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/70d178bc7d6b5ddfd6c3ddb3aebc620b.poster.avif?t=1755506693\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/70d178bc7d6b5ddfd6c3ddb3aebc620b.webm?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/70d178bc7d6b5ddfd6c3ddb3aebc620b.mp4?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different types of objects to build with and they interact with each<br>other in different ways. After each level you will be able to compare your score with<br>all who beat the level before you, can you get the top score?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/a9a0681ff1f7ad9b00f4726d6d6b4e7d.poster.avif?t=1755506693\" width=1600 height=898 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/a9a0681ff1f7ad9b00f4726d6d6b4e7d.webm?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/a9a0681ff1f7ad9b00f4726d6d6b4e7d.mp4?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own levels when you unlock the level editor, send  your creations to a friend or receive them from other players via our discord and play an unlimited amount of levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save and Load Level Solutions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling stuck? Have a friend send their solution to a puzzle or hop on over to our Discord server and ask for help so that you can get those tricky achievements. Your three best solutions for each level are always saved. Just go back if you ever forget how get as high as your personal best!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this physics-based building puzzle platformer, <i>you</i> place the platforms and must then reach the top of your own creations. Help Bob through 42 meticulously crafted levels in his career from apprentice to architect by building the tallest structures imaginable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trust me, I'm an engineer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/5fcb143446fd5b05459b3c7c6162672d.poster.avif?t=1755506693\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/5fcb143446fd5b05459b3c7c6162672d.webm?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/5fcb143446fd5b05459b3c7c6162672d.mp4?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engineering degree or not, with your help Bob can prevail!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/0458f07ab480e59b284dc59535c2de1c.poster.avif?t=1755506693\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/0458f07ab480e59b284dc59535c2de1c.webm?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/0458f07ab480e59b284dc59535c2de1c.mp4?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, you're faced with new challenges and can only use a finite number of objects. Place, rotate and stack the objects to make them fit where you want and ultimately create a climbable structure that takes you to the top. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/70d178bc7d6b5ddfd6c3ddb3aebc620b.poster.avif?t=1755506693\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/70d178bc7d6b5ddfd6c3ddb3aebc620b.webm?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/70d178bc7d6b5ddfd6c3ddb3aebc620b.mp4?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different types of objects to build with and they interact with each<br>other in different ways. After each level you will be able to compare your score with<br>all who beat the level before you, can you get the top score?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/a9a0681ff1f7ad9b00f4726d6d6b4e7d.poster.avif?t=1755506693\" width=1600 height=898 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/a9a0681ff1f7ad9b00f4726d6d6b4e7d.webm?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/a9a0681ff1f7ad9b00f4726d6d6b4e7d.mp4?t=1755506693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own levels when you unlock the level editor, send  your creations to a friend or receive them from other players via our discord and play an unlimited amount of levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save and Load Level Solutions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling stuck? Have a friend send their solution to a puzzle or hop on over to our Discord server and ask for help so that you can get those tricky achievements. Your three best solutions for each level are always saved. Just go back if you ever forget how get as high as your personal best!</p>",
    "short_description": "Stack, twist, and balance your way to record-breaking heights in this physics-based building puzzle platformer. Create the tallest, most daring structures imaginable, compete for high scores, design your own levels, and help Bob reach for the sky!",
